    reading: 'The audit comes out clean for everything the argument needs. It had to be done twice to get there: the first pass was reported as complete while roll angle rested on a subagent report of a page nobody here had opened and the engine channels rested on absence from a list read in fragments. Both now hold on direct reading. Four channels still rest on absence rather than sight and are marked as such. What it did produce is the rule: presence in the tabulation is not a validation certificate, and the attachment that decides it is a separate document from the one carrying the numbers.',
